    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d767">

                <pb facs="0970" n="960" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg960"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4–1647: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Smith</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-04-16T00:00:00+03:00">April 16,
                            1947—midnight</date>.<lb/>[Received April 17—2:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1411. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kosmos</hi> 47. From Marshall: My <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Kosmos</hi> 43<anchor n="46" xml:id="d767-f1"/> on
                    abandonment of ammunition refers. Change last paragraph as follows:</p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>) Insert after fourth word the phrase “if inquiry
                    is made” and (<hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>) delete all words after “national
                    government”.</p>
                <p>I do not want a press release and believe our reply in event question arises
                    should be forceful and direct. [Marshall]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Smith</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d767-f1" n="46" xml:id="d767-f1-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
